{
  "id": "repro-cache-compression",
  "description": "Faster Cache Compression: 10 minutes of Sim builds and lot loads fill the caches (populated lots, 3 outfit changes and 3 new Sims per jump), then two saves write them. Pass: both saves complete; A/B metric: frames over 50 ms per minute in the window, and the save steps in the harness table.",
  "save": "ApexTest-Town",
  "variants": {
